    <custom_item>
      type        : RPM_CHECK
      description : "AZLX-23-001195 - Amazon Linux 2023 must have the crypto-policies package installed."
      info        : "Centralized cryptographic policies simplify applying secure ciphers across an operating system and the applications that run on that operating system. Use of weak or untested encryption algorithms undermines the purposes of utilizing encryption to protect data.

Satisfies: SRG-OS-000396-GPOS-00176, SRG-OS-000393-GPOS-00173, SRG-OS-000394-GPOS-00174, SRG-OS-000424-GPOS-00188"
