      <then>
        <report type:"PASSED">
          description : "AZLX-23-001305 - Amazon Linux 2023 must prohibit the use of cached authenticators after one day."
          info        : "If cached authentication information is out-of-date, the validity of the authentication information may be questionable."
          solution    : "Configure Amazon Linux 2023 SSSD service to prohibit the use of cached authentications after one day.

Add or change the following line in \"/etc/sssd/sssd.conf\" just below the line [pam]:

offline_credentials_expiration = 1"
