Satisfies: SRG-OS-000342-GPOS-00133, SRG-OS-000479-GPOS-00224"
          solution    : "Configure Amazon Linux 2023 to off-load audit records onto a different system or media from the system being audited.

If using systemd-journal-upload:
Edit \"/etc/systemd/journal-upload.conf\" with the appropriate configuration:

[Upload]
URL=https://[server.domain]:[port]"
          reference   : "800-53|AU-4(1),800-53r5|AU-4(1),CAT|III,CCI|CCI-001851,CSF|PR.DS-4,CSF|PR.PT-1,DISA_Benchmark|Amazon_Linux_2023_STIG,GDPR|32.1.b,HIPAA|164.306(a)(1),HIPAA|164.312(b),ISO-27001-2022|A.8.6,ITSG-33|AU-4,NESA|T3.3.1,NESA|T3.6.2,QCSC-v1|8.2.1,QCSC-v1|13.2,Rule-ID|SV-274080r1120228_rule,STIG-ID|AZLX-23-002080,Vuln-ID|V-274080"
